{"unit_id":"firestige__crystra-dsh#card-zh","repo":"firestige/crystra-dsh","commit":"ce0d28ed778b14913481b2ab9db9b932698e534d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-crystra 是面向 DSH Web 的工作流执行与分析插件。它通过 /crystra 命令接入初始化和工作流操作，并在 DSH 界面提供任务、工作流与分析页面。用户可以浏览和管理任务、查看及打开本地工作流、为任务整理 Brief 与计划，并在分析区查看交付记录、调用轨迹和对比报告。插件还集成 Execution 与 Studio 服务，支持检查配置和服务状态。适合希望在 DSH 中把可复用工作流用于任务执行，并查看运行记录的用户。工作流来源会查询 GitHub Releases；服务初始化及分析依赖相应的本机服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:22","src/index.js:71","src/client/shell/register.tsx:57","src/client/analysis/host-analysis.tsx:16"]}
{"unit_id":"firestige__crystra-dsh#card-en","repo":"firestige/crystra-dsh","commit":"ce0d28ed778b14913481b2ab9db9b932698e534d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-crystra adds workflows and analysis to DSH Web. Use /crystra for setup and workflow tasks. Pages manage tasks, open local workflows, prepare briefs and plans, and review delivery metrics, traces, and reports. Workflow data comes from GitHub Releases; setup and analysis use local services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:22","src/index.js:71","src/client/shell/register.tsx:57","src/client/analysis/host-analysis.tsx:16"]}
